                                "example_id": "a4359ab0-a81d-4fc0-91d7-37f5b8404c6d",
                                "sense_id": "4550dcb7-00a3-3279-ad03-9a444975adea",
                                "text": "Before you could count three, every soldier was surrounded by at least a dozen of the worst cut-throats that ever drew breath, and for a little time things looked mighty juberous for us Yankees."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "946c1778-cedb-4e64-850d-4006c19cae0c",
                                "sense_id": "4550dcb7-00a3-3279-ad03-9a444975adea",
                                "text": "“I tell you,” Aunt Mary says, “I got a little juberous before we got to Chicago. I didn't know whether I'd get the right Parmalee taxi or not. I did feel pretty juberous.”"
